        ## AKR @akr.papercut.collated-2-papercuts-from-evidence-intake
        Collated 2 papercuts from /mnt/Samsung980_1TB/Rust-projects on 2026-08-09 (D-030). Each source key is also in the collated slot, which is the dedup set for the next run; the sisters were read and never written. ## SaveYourSkin @saveyourskin.papercut.fff-find-files-transport-closed-while-locating [about FFF] FFF find_files transport closed while locating the user-directed Sources/current-plan-80626.md, so discovery had to fall back to direct read-only shell inspection. ## SaveYourSkin @saveyourskin.papercut.knowledge-context-accepted-budget-tokens-18000 [about akr] knowledge.context accepted budget_tokens=18000 but then withheld a 16208-token bundle because of an undocumented 4000-token response ceiling; callers should be told/capped before the expensive assembly.

