    state verified
    statement """
        The recipe that turned stock PaddleOCR ONNX exports into the embedded lege-ocr/assets was never committed — the v5 assets had their graph input renamed and BN folded out of band, and nothing in the tree recorded it. Rediscovering it cost most of the v6 migration. Now captured as lege-process/scripts/prepare_ppocr_models.py; any future embedded model should ship its prep script in the same commit.
        """
    observed_at git:3f520cc03211e48adaa77c1da9bc639c53d2d351
    author "claude"
    created_at 2026-08-22
}

